# Lens profile controls.
lens_profiles.invalid = Paw Lensfun v1/v2 XML database a ɛfata (ɛkɔ 8 MiB) a ɛwɔ camera anaa lens data a wɔboa.
lens_profiles.calibration = Lens calibration a wɔde yɛ adwuma
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Calibration biara nkata nhyehyɛe ahorow yi so. Hwɛ focal length ne camera crop factor; nsaano nteɛso da so ara wɔ hɔ.
lens_profiles.import = Fa Lensfun XML a ɛwɔ amannɔne ba...
lens_profiles.imported = Lensfun database a wɔde aba ama saa nhyiam yi. Paw profael anaa fa mfonini metadata no hyia.
lens_profiles.manual = Nsaano nteɛso nkutoo
lens_profiles.saved = Calibration a wɔakora so (database no nni hɔ) .
lens_profiles.profile = Lens no ho nsɛm
lens_profiles.aperture = Aperture (0 = wonnim) .
lens_profiles.distance = Ɔkwan a wɔfa so de wɔn adwene si biribi so (0 = wonnim) .
lens_profiles.vignette = Vignetting a wɔasusuw ahyehyɛ
lens_profiles.color_context = Vignetting a wɔasusuw ahyehyɛ no hia sRGB profael a ɛwɔ dwumadie no mu. Dan mfonini no kɔ sRGB mu na sɛnea ɛte no ansesa, afei san bue Lens Nsiesiei. Sɛ piksel no wɔ sRGB mu dedaw nanso wɔnnkyerɛɛ wɔn profael a, ɛdɔɔso sɛ wode sRGB profael no bɛma wɔn. Wubetumi akɔ so asiesie mfonini no nsɛso ne kɔla ano.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Vignetting calibration biara nni hɔ a ɛkata aperture ne focus distance no so. Hyehyɛ gyinapɛn ahorow a wɔasusuw na ama ayɛ yiye; 1000 m gyina hɔ ma akyirikyiri adwene wɔ Lensfun profile ahorow pii mu.
lens_profiles.note = Wɔde calibration a wɔayɛ no di dwuma ansa na nsaano nhyehyɛe no aba. Fa mfitiase mfonini a ɛyɛ mũ no di dwuma; twa no akyi. Fa filter stack no sie wɔ PSD/PSB mu na calibration no akɔ so atumi asesa.
lens_profiles.automatic = Fa mfonini metadata hyia
lens_profiles.components = Profile pass: nsɛm a wɔkyinkyim {distortion}; kɔla ahorow a ɛyɛ fĩ {tca}; vignetting a wɔde {vignette} ayɛ.
